{"ts": 0.459378, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[1;97m✓ Stage 2 cleared.\u001b[0m\r\n\r\nYou can now:\r\n  \u001b[92mls            \u001b[0m \u001b[90mlist what is here\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[92mls -p         \u001b[0m \u001b[90mmark folders with /\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[92mls -a         \u001b[0m \u001b[90minclude hidden names\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[92mcd            \u001b[0m \u001b[90mchange folder\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[92mcd ..         \u001b[0m \u001b[90mgo up one folder\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[92mcd ~          \u001b[0m \u001b[90mgo to your home folder\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[92mcd -          \u001b[0m \u001b[90mgo back to the last folder\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[92mpwd           \u001b[0m \u001b[90mshow where you are\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n\u001b[90mNext: Stage 3 · Files and operations\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n\u001b[93m▶ Type \u001b[92mnext\u001b[93m for Stage 3, or \u001b[92mquit\u001b[93m to stop here. Your place is saved.\u001b[0m\r\n", "len": 648}
